{"instance_id": "swe-requests-0001", "repo": "psf/requests", "base_commit": "6e83187b8feb273ed4c6cdab5efd8d54901dfab3", "problem_statement": "Session.merge_environment_settings ignores per-request proxy settings when trust_env is False, so requests sent through an explicitly configured proxy fall back to a direct connection. Fix the merge order so explicit per-request proxies always win.", "target_files": ["src/requests/sessions.py"], "grading_command": "cd /repo && python -m pytest tests/test_requests.py -q -k 'proxy or environment'", "fail_to_pass": ["tests/test_requests.py::TestRequests"], "pass_to_pass": ["tests/test_structures.py"]}
{"instance_id": "swe-requests-0002", "repo": "psf/requests", "base_commit": "6e83187b8feb273ed4c6cdab5efd8d54901dfab3", "problem_statement": "requests.utils.get_encoding_from_headers returns None for Content-Type headers that include a quoted charset parameter (e.g. text/html; charset=\"utf-8\"), causing incorrect fallback decoding. Strip surrounding quotes from the charset value.", "target_files": ["src/requests/utils.py"], "grading_command": "cd /repo && python -m pytest tests/test_utils.py -q", "fail_to_pass": ["tests/test_utils.py"], "pass_to_pass": ["tests/test_structures.py"]}
{"instance_id": "swe-requests-0003", "repo": "psf/requests", "base_commit": "6e83187b8feb273ed4c6cdab5efd8d54901dfab3", "problem_statement": "HTTPAdapter.send raises a bare ValueError instead of requests.exceptions.InvalidURL when the target URL has an invalid label, leaking urllib3 internals to callers. Wrap the error in the documented exception type.", "target_files": ["src/requests/adapters.py"], "grading_command": "cd /repo && python -m pytest tests/test_adapters.py tests/test_requests.py -q -k 'invalid'", "fail_to_pass": ["tests/test_adapters.py"], "pass_to_pass": ["tests/test_help.py"]}
